Add SAST (Static Application Security Testing) to GitHub Actions.

Integrate a static analysis tool into CI to catch security issues automatically.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] SAST tool runs on every PR (CodeQL, Semgrep, or cppcheck)
- [ ] Findings reported as PR annotations or comments
- [ ] No critical/high findings in current codebase (or documented exceptions)
- [ ] Workflow defined in .github/workflows/

## Test Plan
- [ ] Push PR, verify SAST job runs
- [ ] Introduce a known issue (buffer overflow), verify it's flagged
- [ ] Verify no false positives blocking PRs
